# Formspree Form ID
# 1. Sign up or log in at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form (e.g. named "Portfolio Contact")
# 3. Copy the Form ID (the endpoint code like "xpwzvepq" from https://formspree.io/f/xpwzvepq)
# 4. Paste it below or directly in src/components/homepage/Contact.jsx
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=YOUR_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID
